{
  "pasos": [
    {
      "etapa": {
        "en": "Tú or usted?"
      },
      "tipo": "explica",
      "dice": {
        "en": "Spanish has two ways to say «you»: **tú** for friends, family and children; **usted** to be formal. Move the levers and watch the verb change!"
      },
      "palancas": [
        {
          "titulo": {
            "en": "How are you?"
          },
          "posiciones": [
            {
              "etiqueta": "tú",
              "es": "¿Cómo est**ás**?",
              "trad": {
                "en": "how are you? (to a friend)"
              }
            },
            {
              "etiqueta": "usted",
              "es": "¿Cómo est**á** usted?",
              "trad": {
                "en": "how are you? (formal)"
              }
            }
          ],
          "retos": [
            {
              "pide": {
                "en": "You talk to an old lady you don't know."
              },
              "correcta": 1
            },
            {
              "pide": {
                "en": "You talk to a child."
              },
              "correcta": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "titulo": {
            "en": "What's your name?"
          },
          "posiciones": [
            {
              "etiqueta": "tú",
              "es": "¿Cómo **te llamas**?",
              "trad": {
                "en": "what's your name? (to a friend)"
              }
            },
            {
              "etiqueta": "usted",
              "es": "¿Cómo **se llama**?",
              "trad": {
                "en": "what's your name? (formal)"
              }
            }
          ],
          "retos": [
            {
              "pide": {
                "en": "Ask your new doctor."
              },
              "correcta": 1
            },
            {
              "pide": {
                "en": "Ask a classmate of your age."
              },
              "correcta": 0
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "titulo": {
            "en": "Excuse me"
          },
          "posiciones": [
            {
              "etiqueta": "tú",
              "es": "Perdon**a**.",
              "trad": {
                "en": "sorry, excuse me (to a friend)"
              }
            },
            {
              "etiqueta": "usted",
              "es": "Perdon**e**.",
              "trad": {
                "en": "sorry, excuse me (formal)"
              }
            }
          ],
          "retos": [
            {
              "pide": {
                "en": "You bump into a customer."
              },
              "correcta": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "despues": {
        "en": "With **usted** the verb takes the «he / she» form. If you are not sure, start with usted."
      }
    },
    {
      "etapa": {
        "en": "Tú or usted?"
      },
      "tipo": "clasifica",
      "dice": {
        "en": "Now help me sort. I show you a person or a sentence; tap the sign where it belongs and I'll carry it there."
      },
      "cestas": [
        {
          "id": "tu",
          "titulo": "TÚ",
          "nota": {
            "en": "friends, family, children"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "usted",
          "titulo": "USTED",
          "nota": {
            "en": "strangers, formal"
          }
        }
      ],
      "cosas": [
        {
          "texto": {
            "en": "a child"
          },
          "cesta": "tu",
          "por": {
            "en": "Children: always **tú**."
          }
        },
        {
          "texto": {
            "en": "an older stranger in the street"
          },
          "cesta": "usted",
          "por": {
            "en": "An older person you don't know: **usted**."
          }
        },
        {
          "texto": {
            "en": "your best friend"
          },
          "cesta": "tu",
          "por": {
            "en": "Friends: **tú**."
          }
        },
        {
          "texto": {
            "en": "your doctor"
          },
          "cesta": "usted",
          "por": {
            "en": "A doctor, a customer, a formal meeting: **usted**."
          }
        },
        {
          "texto": {
            "en": "your sister"
          },
          "cesta": "tu",
          "por": {
            "en": "Family: **tú**."
          }
        },
        {
          "texto": "¿Cómo estás?",
          "cesta": "tu",
          "por": {
            "en": "**Estás**, with **-s**: the tú form."
          }
        },
        {
          "texto": "¿Cómo está?",
          "cesta": "usted",
          "por": {
            "en": "**Está**, without **-s**: the usted form. It is the same form as for él and ella."
          }
        },
        {
          "texto": "Perdone.",
          "cesta": "usted",
          "por": {
            "en": "**Perdone**, with **-e**: usted. To a friend you say **perdona**."
          }
        },
        {
          "texto": "¿Cómo te llamas?",
          "cesta": "tu",
          "por": {
            "en": "**Te llamas**: tú. With usted it becomes **se llama**."
          }
        },
        {
          "texto": "¿Cómo se llama?",
          "cesta": "usted",
          "por": {
            "en": "**Se llama**: usted. With tú it is **te llamas**."
          }
        },
        {
          "texto": "Te presento a Ana.",
          "cesta": "tu",
          "por": {
            "en": "**Te** presento: tú. With usted: **Le** presento a…"
          }
        },
        {
          "texto": "Perdona.",
          "cesta": "tu",
          "por": {
            "en": "**Perdona**, with **-a**: tú. To a stranger: **perdone**."
          }
        }
      ],
      "despues": {
        "en": "If you are not sure, start with **usted**. People will tell you: «Puedes tutearme», you can use tú with me."
      }
    },
    {
      "etapa": {
        "en": "Tú or usted?"
      },
      "tipo": "reto",
      "bloque": 4,
      "dice": {
        "en": "First check. A real situation."
      }
    },
    {
      "etapa": {
        "en": "Tú or usted?"
      },
      "tipo": "reto",
      "bloque": 5,
      "dice": {
        "en": "Second check. With **-s** or without?"
      }
    },
    {
      "etapa": {
        "en": "Polite words"
      },
      "tipo": "paseo",
      "dice": {
        "en": "We are at the office, and everything is formal here. Tap a place and I'll go there and say what fits."
      },
      "sitios": [
        {
          "donde": {
            "en": "you greet Mr Ruiz"
          },
          "es": "Buenos días, señor Ruiz.",
          "trad": {
            "en": "good morning, **Mr** Ruiz"
          }
        },
        {
          "donde": {
            "en": "you greet Mrs Ruiz"
          },
          "es": "Buenos días, señora Ruiz.",
          "trad": {
            "en": "good morning, **Mrs** Ruiz"
          }
        },
        {
          "donde": {
            "en": "you meet someone new"
          },
          "es": "Mucho gusto.",
          "trad": {
            "en": "pleased to meet you (anyone can say it)"
          }
        },
        {
          "donde": {
            "en": "they say «Mucho gusto»"
          },
          "es": "Igualmente.",
          "trad": {
            "en": "likewise"
          }
        },
        {
          "donde": {
            "en": "you introduce Ana to your boss"
          },
          "es": "Le presento a Ana.",
          "trad": {
            "en": "let me introduce Ana (formal: **le**)"
          }
        },
        {
          "donde": {
            "en": "you introduce Ana to a friend"
          },
          "es": "Te presento a Ana.",
          "trad": {
            "en": "let me introduce Ana (to a friend: **te**)"
          }
        }
      ],
      "despues": {
        "en": "**Mucho gusto**, **Igualmente**. With those two you can meet anybody."
      }
    },
    {
      "etapa": {
        "en": "Polite words"
      },
      "tipo": "cartas",
      "dice": {
        "en": "Now the words. Listen to each card and choose what it means."
      },
      "palabras": [
        "usted",
        "el señor",
        "la señora",
        "mucho gusto",
        "igualmente",
        "perdone",
        "perdona",
        "ustedes"
      ],
      "despues": {
        "en": "**Mucho gusto** and the answer **igualmente**: with those two you can meet anybody."
      }
    },
    {
      "etapa": {
        "en": "Polite words"
      },
      "tipo": "reto",
      "bloque": 7,
      "dice": {
        "en": "Third check. What does it mean?"
      }
    },
    {
      "etapa": {
        "en": "At the office"
      },
      "tipo": "rol",
      "bloque": 2,
      "papel": "Pablo",
      "dice": {
        "en": "You are **Pablo**, at the office. I am Mrs Ruiz, your boss, so be formal with me! And you will introduce Lucía."
      },
      "extras": [
        {
          "es": "Buenos días, señora Ruiz. ¿Cómo estás?",
          "trad": {
            "en": "Good morning, Mrs Ruiz. How are you? (the tú form: too familiar for your boss)"
          }
        },
        {
          "es": "Bien. Te presento a Lucía.",
          "trad": {
            "en": "Fine. Let me introduce Lucía. (the tú form: too familiar here)"
          }
        },
        {
          "es": "Perdona.",
          "trad": {
            "en": "Sorry. (the tú form)"
          }
        }
      ],
      "despues": {
        "en": "Very professional, Pablo. **Le presento a…** is how you introduce someone formally."
      }
    },
    {
      "etapa": {
        "en": "At the office"
      },
      "tipo": "reto",
      "bloque": 8,
      "dice": {
        "en": "Fourth check. Build the formal introduction."
      }
    },
    {
      "etapa": {
        "en": "At the office"
      },
      "tipo": "reto",
      "bloque": 6,
      "dice": {
        "en": "Fifth check. Change **tú** into **usted** yourself."
      }
    },
    {
      "etapa": {
        "en": "Reading"
      },
      "tipo": "lectura",
      "dice": {
        "en": "Last reading of this unit, and it uses everything you have learnt. No sound, no translation."
      },
      "titulo": {
        "en": "✉ A message at the office"
      },
      "texto": [
        "Buenos días, señora Ruiz. ¿Cómo está usted?",
        "Me llamo Pablo y soy de España.",
        "Tengo treinta años.",
        "Le presento a Lan. Es de Vietnam.",
        "Perdone, ¿cómo se escribe Ruiz?",
        "Mucho gusto y hasta luego."
      ],
      "preguntas": [
        {
          "pregunta": {
            "en": "Is Pablo writing to a friend?"
          },
          "opciones": [
            {
              "texto": {
                "en": "No, this is formal"
              },
              "correcta": true,
              "explica": {
                "en": "Right: **señora**, **usted**, **le presento**, **perdone**. All formal."
              }
            },
            {
              "texto": {
                "en": "Yes, to a friend"
              },
              "explica": {
                "en": "A friend would get **¿Cómo estás?** Look at the first line."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "pregunta": {
            "en": "How old is Pablo? **Tap the sentence.**"
          },
          "linea": 2,
          "bien": {
            "en": "Yes: **Tengo treinta años**. He is thirty."
          },
          "mal": {
            "en": "Not that one. Look for **tengo … años**."
          }
        },
        {
          "pregunta": {
            "en": "Who is from Vietnam?"
          },
          "opciones": [
            {
              "texto": {
                "en": "Lan"
              },
              "correcta": true,
              "explica": {
                "en": "Yes: **Le presento a Lan. Es de Vietnam.**"
              }
            },
            {
              "texto": {
                "en": "Pablo"
              },
              "explica": {
                "en": "Pablo says **soy de España**."
              }
            },
            {
              "texto": {
                "en": "Mrs Ruiz"
              },
              "explica": {
                "en": "The message doesn't say where she is from."
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "pregunta": {
            "en": "Pablo is not sure about a spelling. **Tap the sentence.**"
          },
          "linea": 4,
          "bien": {
            "en": "Yes: **¿cómo se escribe Ruiz?** And he starts with **perdone**."
          },
          "mal": {
            "en": "Not that one. Look for **se escribe**."
          }
        },
        {
          "pregunta": {
            "en": "How does Pablo say «pleased to meet you»?"
          },
          "opciones": [
            {
              "texto": {
                "en": "Mucho gusto"
              },
              "correcta": true,
              "explica": {
                "en": "Yes. And she can answer **igualmente**."
              }
            },
            {
              "texto": {
                "en": "Hasta luego"
              },
              "explica": {
                "en": "That is «see you later»."
              }
            },
            {
              "texto": {
                "en": "Perdone"
              },
              "explica": {
                "en": "That is «excuse me»."
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "despues": {
        "en": "Greetings, names, countries, ages, spelling and usted: that message had the whole unit in it. And you read it alone!"
      }
    },
    {
      "etapa": {
        "en": "Off screen"
      },
      "tipo": "mision",
      "bloque": 9,
      "dice": {
        "en": "Last thing, **away from the screen**. I can't check it, so I trust you."
      }
    },
    {
      "etapa": {
        "en": "Off screen"
      },
      "tipo": "fin"
    }
  ]
}
